          "en": "Pele was in danger. But her mother, Haumea, protected her."
        },
        {
          "es": "La mandó a esconderse junto a su hermano mayor, Kamohoaliʻi.",
          "en": "She sent her to hide beside her older brother, Kamohoaliʻi."
        },
        {
          "es": "Kamohoaliʻi era el rey de los tiburones. Era tan poderoso que pocos se atrevían a acercarse.",
          "en": "Kamohoaliʻi was the king of the sharks. He was so powerful that few dared to come near him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero ese escondite no podía durar para siempre.",
          "en": "But that hiding place could not last forever."
        },
        {
          "es": "Para estar a salvo, Pele tenía que irse de Kahiki.",
          "en": "To be safe, Pele had to leave Kahiki."
