          "es": "La hermana más chica de la familia todavía no había nacido. Era un huevo.",
          "en": "The youngest sister in the family had not been born yet. She was an egg."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¿Qué vas a hacer con tu hermanita del huevo?», le preguntaron a Pele.",
          "en": "\"What will you do with your little egg sister?\" they asked Pele."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pele tomó el huevo, lo envolvió en su falda y lo guardó contra su cuerpo, para darle calor.",
          "en": "Pele took the egg, wrapped it in her skirt, and held it close to her body to keep it warm."
        },
        {
          "es": "«Va a estar siempre conmigo», dijo. Esa hermanita se llamaría Hiʻiaka.",
          "en": "\"She will always be with me,\" she said. That little sister would be named Hiʻiaka."
        }
      ],
